      { text: 'Over the past year, I have been self-studying foundations related to game theory, logic, and learning theory, both so that I can communicate and collaborate with others on theoretical and mathematical topics and, more importantly, to improve myself. I am still looking for the direction that fits me best; over the past month, I have found myself especially interested in proof-related topics.' },
